                    </p>
                    <ul>
                        <li><strong>"Account"</strong> means the administrative record and credentials established by Customer to access the Service.</li>
                        <li><strong>"Workspace"</strong> or <strong>"Organization Tenant"</strong> means the isolated, multi-tenant digital environment provisioned for Customer's organization, within which Users manage real estate inventory, lead inquiries, client pipelines, and internal notes.</li>
